SUMMARY:Lancaster Bike Club  Adopt A Highway Cleanup
DESCRIPTION:Lancaster Bicycle Club (LBC) Meetup\nJoin us for a 34 year Lan
 caster Bike Club tradition.\nWhen: Sat. July 18th 7am breakfast\; cleanup 
 around 8am.\nWhere: Centerville Diner - 100 S. Centerville Road\, Lancaste
 r.\nOur section is a two mile stretch on Columbia Ave between Roherstown R
 oad and Donnerville Road. Park near Painting with a Twist toward the back 
 of the lot.\nWhat: Breakfast at Centerville Diner\, followed by cleanup (b
 ags\, gloves\, etc are provided)\, then an optional ride.\nWhy: Keep our l
 ongstanding tradition going strong! Help beautify our neighborhood. Enjoy 
 the camaraderie of club members!\nFor questions contact Allan at apawliko@
 comcast.net or 717-682-8063.\n\nBeing a Meetup Member does not mean you ar
 e a club member. Use this link to join the club.\n[https://www.lancasterbi
 keclub.net/content.aspx?page_id=60&club_id=257148](https://www.lancasterbi
 keclub.net/content.aspx?page_id=60&club_id=257148)\nYour RSVP is your agre
 ement to abide by the club's Code of Conduct [https://lancbikeclub.clubexp
 ress.com/content.aspx?page_id=22&club_id=257148&module_id=323984](https://
 lancbikeclub.clubexpress.com/content.aspx?page_id=22&club_id=257148&module
 _id=323984)
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/lancaster-bicycle-club/events/3139433
 67/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260325T152338Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260325T152338Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
