SUMMARY:Ride the NJ side of the Delaware River Canal Trail 30 mile F RSVP 
 required
DESCRIPTION:Lancaster Bicycle Club (LBC) Meetup\n**there are 15 folks sign
 ed up on this ride from the Wilmington Club. so there's still room for peo
 ple from Lancaster**\n**Warning: Only class 1 e-bikes are allowed on NJ tr
 ails. Max 20mph\, no throttle**\n\n**Join Members and friends from the Lan
 caster and Wilmington Clubs on a ride on the New Jersey side of the Delawa
 re River canal from Washington’s Crossing Pa to Bulls Island\, New Jerse
 y and back.**\n**Leaving the parking lot at 10am\, we will cross bridge in
 to NJ then north to Lambertville\, to Stockton\, to Bull’s Island. Comin
 g back we will stop in Lambertville at Owowcow ice cream before finishing 
 the ride.**\n**This is a casual ride with no one left behind. Bring plenty
  of water to drink and a snack to eat when we reach Bull Island. Do not go
  on this ride unless you promise to stay with the group.**\n**Surface is a
 ll crushed stone. Like always a helmet is required and you must have a tub
 e so someone can fix your flat.**\n**Back in Washington’s Crossing\, you
  may choose to go with us to Dominick’s pizza shop at end of our ride.**
 \n**To eliminate passing around a pen and paper waiver\, we encourage memb
 ership in our clubs. RSVP also allows us to contact you after the ride if 
 needed. If you do not RSVP you are not covered by the club excess accident
  insurance. Being on Meetup does not mean you are a club member. Join here
 - [https://www.lancasterbikeclub.net/content.aspx?page_id=60&club_id=25714
 8](https://www.lancasterbikeclub.net/content.aspx?page_id=60&club_id=25714
 8)**\n**Your RSVP is your agreement to abide by the club's Code of Conduct
 :**
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/lancaster-bicycle-club/events/3154556
 82/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260628T153643Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260628T153643Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
